{"sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","items":[{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k001","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"난용성 염 MₐXᵦ의 용해도곱은 Ksp=a(M)^a a(X)^b로 정의한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k002","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"순수 물의 몰용해도 s에 대해 단순 해리 근사에서는 각 이온 농도가 as,bs이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k003","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"예를 들어 AgCl은 Ksp=s², CaF₂는 Ksp=4s³이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k004","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"혼합 용액에서는 혼합 후 농도를 사용해 이온곱 Qsp를 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k005","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"Qsp>Ksp이면 침전 방향이 열역학적으로 유리하고 Qsp<Ksp이면 불포화 상태다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k006","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"공통이온은 일반적으로 난용성 염의 용해도를 낮춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--solubility-k007","sectionId":"equilibrium/solubility","unitI